name:           lazyppl-singlesite
version:        0.2.0
synopsis:       Single-site Metropolis-Hastings for LazyPPL
description:    Single-site Metropolis-Hastings for LazyPPL. Import LazyPPL.SingleSite
                to use mh1. The sampler discovers evaluated random choices through GHC's heap.
                A known limit: mh1 evaluates each result to normal form, so for an infinite
                result, such as an infinite list, it yields the initial draw and then never
                yields the next pair. mh from LazyPPL.Inference.Run has no such limit and is
                the general recommendation.
category:       Statistics
stability:      experimental
homepage:       https://lazyppl-team.github.io/
bug-reports:    https://github.com/lazyppl-team/lazyppl/issues
author:         LazyPPL team
maintainer:     sam.staton@cs.ox.ac.uk
